00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.810
What's that noise?

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:17.030
Don't worry. There are soldiers all around to protect us.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.870
Hey, play me some lavish music!

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.790
As you wish!

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:37.930
What's wrong?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.740
I just saw something!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.760
What happened?

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.370
It's a monster! Monster!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.000
Calm down!

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:56.980
Hey!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.010
Mommy!

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:58.690
No!

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.610
Calm down!

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.090
What? What?

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:11.470
Oh my!

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:22.980
If you value your life, leave your possessions now, and run.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.890
G-God save me!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.140
What are you doing?! Keep going!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:29.940
Yes, sir!

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.000
They're closing in from both sides!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.700
We're done for!

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.880
Hey, Borka! You bum!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:52.540
Huh?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.380
Mattis! You shameless scoundrel!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:59.890
This is our territory! Go on back to your hovel

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:04.390
Right back at you! You won't take my treasure that easily!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.400
<i>Your</i> treasure?! I think you mean <i>my</i> treasure!

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.460
If you touch even one piece of my treasure,

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:14.900
I'll push you and your friends straight to the pits of hell!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.810
This treasure is mine!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:21.630
We've been tracking them since before they even entered this forest!

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.910
No, we were here first! You can't just waltz in and take my treasure!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:25.810
Are you picking a fight?

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:27.420
What did you say?

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.030
You're going to pay for this!

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:29.950
You're the ones who are gonna pay!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.270
We'll see. Stop your horse!

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:34.430
You stop first!

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.530
Boss!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.780
Boss! It's an emergency!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.740
What's wrong?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:32.580
Boss! Hurry up!

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.010
Hiyah!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.580
Hurry!

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.160
Yah! Yah!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:05:59.600
Hah!

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.860
Mattis!

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.740
Hey, open the gate!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.620
Incredible!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:38.880
Huh?

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.380
Lovis!

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.220
Where is Lovis?

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.390
She's upstairs, as usual.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.610
Lovis!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:13.970
Lovis!

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:20.380
Was the baby delivered?

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:27.790
Of course not.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:33.330
But you... I heard that you started moaning while holding your belly...

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:40.210
Babies choose exactly when they want to be born.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.470
All we can do is wait.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:57.380
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:57.380
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:30.580
Ouch...

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:39.840
Drive that hell-harpy away and let me have some quiet.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:42.090
Otherwise I won't hear what I'm singing!

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:45.500
What? Are you going to bear a child while singing?

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:51.550
I have no doubt that it will make it easier on me and...

00:08:56.900 --> 00:09:02.110
If it arrived on earth to the sound of a song, then it'll grow up to be jolly.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:07.450
If you understand, then get to it!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:12.530
Ouch...

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.970
Off with you, harpies!

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.550
I'm going to have a baby tonight.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.310
Get that into your heads, you hags!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.320
Dammit!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.420
Ho, ho, you're going to have a baby tonight.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:10.340
A thunder-and-lightning baby, small and ugly it'll be, ho, ho!

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.930
It will grow up short and small and ugly, right?

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.190
Shut up, you damn harpy!! My child won't be ugly at all!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.940
You hear me?!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.570
Hey!

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:51.050
<i>Wolves, wolves...</i>

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:56.470
<i>In the forest at night...</i>

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:06.350
<i>You can't sleep while crying...</i>

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:15.050
<i>Your stomachs are empty...</i>

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:22.350
<i>The burrow is cold...</i>

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:32.650
<i>Wolves, wolves...</i>

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:39.810
<i>Get away from here...</i>

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:50.280
<i>I won't give my sweet baby to you...</i>

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.860
That wind sure is something.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.140
It's time for duty in the watch tower.{make it up to the watch tower.}

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.130
Not yet, huh?

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.280
Yeah...

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:00.830
Who thinks the baby is going to be a boy?

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.530
What, this is the stuff you robbed today?

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.820
I'll bet this much!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.680
I'm gonna bet it's a girl!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:26.060
Huh?

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:27.910
What the hell is this?!

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.650
The first child to be born in this castle, huh?

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:35.520
Have you ever held a baby?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.370
It pains me to admit it, but I've never even touched a baby.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.580
I have!

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:45.080
Hey! Be quiet.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:50.080
Oh, do I have to be quiet when she's having the baby?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.850
Of course you have to...

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:55.370
because the baby will... Anyways it's not good...

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.590
Maybe...

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.310
Are you sure?

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.310
Yeah.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:05.180
I can't wait to see this little robber grow up.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:11.700
I'm getting frail; my time here is almost up.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:17.780
It would be fine to see a new robber chief here before I'm finished.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.580
The baby's here.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.920
I've got a child!

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.880
Wow!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.880
Yeah!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:43.930
Do you hear me? I've got a child!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:47.060
I've got a child!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.650
So, is the baby a girl or a boy?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.230
A robber's daughter, joy and gladness!

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.260
Eh?

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.670
Look! She's here!

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:06.740
A robber's daughter! Here she comes!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.710
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:33.520
Here! Want to see the most beautiful child ever born in a robbers' fort?

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:55.120
That child understands just about everything already.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.610
You can see that.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:00.110
What will you call her?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.170
Her name is Ronja.

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:07.560
I decided long time ago that I would name my baby "Ronja".

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:12.060
What were you going to do if the baby was a boy?

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:19.570
If I decide my baby is to be called Ronja, it will be a Ronja!

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:24.070
Shall I take her now?

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:28.080
Are you listening? Mattis.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:37.450
You, baby, you're already holding my robber heart in those little hands.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:44.130
I don't understand it, but that's how it is.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.140
Could I hold her for a while?

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:55.070
I give you the new robber chieftain you've been talking about all this time.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:16:00.420
But, don't you dare drop her like you dropped that bread during lunchtime.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:05.110
If you do, it''ll be your last hour!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:09.820
There's no real weight to her.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:12.120
Whoosh, whoosh.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:16.620
What did you expect, numbskull?

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:21.630
A great fat robber chieftain with a bulging belly and a pointed beard?

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.070
Huh?!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:27.220
Mattis's daughter is the most beautiful girl in this forest!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.730
There's never been a girl as cute as her.

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:31.680
Right? Everyone!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.670
She's our treasure!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.610
That's right!

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:35.730
Yeah!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:45.280
Well said! Let's have a party to celebrate!

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:49.160
Yeah!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.550
This is going to bedevil the life out of Borka.

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:31.950
He can sit there in his miserable robbers' den and gnash his teeth with jealousy.

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:43.210
There will be such a gnashing that all the harpies and gray dwarves in Borka's Wood will hold their ears.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.230
That's right!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:49.720
After all, he doesn't have a successor.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:52.410
They'll soon be finished and done for!

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:55.450
And they will all tumble down into the pits of hell!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:40.870
Goodness gracious, that was a powerful boom.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:46.410
By the devil himself, that lightning must have been really close.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.990
Huh? She's crying!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.070
Wh-What should I do?

00:18:59.070 --> 00:18:59.950
Dunno.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.610
So it was our castle that got struck during yesterday's thunderstorm, right?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.340
It's like a gate to hell.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.300
Look at the boss.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.250
It's understandable.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:24.270
His castle, which his family has lived in for generations, has been reduced to rubble.

00:20:24.270 --> 00:20:26.710
I hope he doesn't get angry and take it out on us.

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:28.220
Don't worry.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:32.390
He won't stay angry at something like this; it's his nature.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.200
See?

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:47.310
You guys remember, right?

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:52.650
That time when Skalle-Per went astray and didn't turn up for four days?

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:56.530
Don't remind me of that horrible experience.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:03.830
I just wanted to find out how big this castle actually was.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.740
And as it turned out...

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:11.320
This castle is large enough to get lost in for four days...

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:29.820
This castle is definitely way too big for us.

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:33.330
So, we shouldn't sweat the small stuff.

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:34.770
Indeed!

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:36.020
Well I guess so.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:38.770
It's just as Mattis said! Right, everyone?

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:40.700
Yeah, that's right!

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.730
But there is one thing that irritates me.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.060
Boss!

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:46.940
The outhouse was over there!

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:11.230
You'll just have to hold it, at least until we make a new one.

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:13.590
No way!

00:22:29.040 --> 00:22:34.750
Ronja, your young life sure has gotten off to a grand start.

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:03.260
And just like that, a new life was born into the Mattis family of forest robbers.

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:06.710
Her name is Ronja.

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:09.900
Ronja, the Robber's Daughter.

